    23 MAY 2026
    Added the option to use gravana.f90 rather than rho_ana.f90 to include
    the effect of the AGAMA potential. This will bypass the potentially numerical unstable steps:
        potential (AGAMA) -> density (AGAMA)-> potential (RAMSES)-> force (RAMSES)
    by doing instead:
        potential (AGAMA) -> force (AGAMA) = force (RAMSES)
    Required adding new directory grav/, and additions to the agama_params block in read_params.f90
    TESTED SUCCESSFULLY with model mmw_m1_a_hyb_pcg

